WEBVTT

00:04.460 --> 00:10.750
<i>We Sinners were cast upon this land 
when the ark crashed.</i>

00:12.370 --> 00:18.480
<i>Now pray, and God shall send 
the angel of salvation our way.</i>

00:19.650 --> 00:25.700
<i>Praise the angel. Honor the angel. 
Become the angel's eyes.</i>

00:26.850 --> 00:29.790
<i>May God bless you.</i>

00:35.970 --> 00:37.450
<i>Dear God...</i>

00:37.450 --> 00:39.920
<i>Please let the wind blow.</i>

00:41.610 --> 00:43.020
<i>Otherwise...</i>

00:43.020 --> 00:44.140
<i>I...</i>

01:02.700 --> 01:06.240
<i>My tears scattered like bits of paper</i>

01:06.240 --> 01:09.950
<i>Scared of the unknowable tomorrow</i>

01:09.950 --> 01:13.470
<i>I lived the same day over and over,
 back and forth</i>

01:13.470 --> 01:17.300
<i>But a new morning never came</i>

01:17.300 --> 01:19.550
<i>All the reasons to calm down</i>

01:19.550 --> 01:23.980
<i>Are just some moments until the crash</i>

01:24.500 --> 01:27.480
<i>I'm no longer the one that everyone knows</i>

01:27.480 --> 01:31.780
<i>Took off the fragile armor</i>

01:31.780 --> 01:38.850
<i>I don't want to lose any more love</i>

01:39.270 --> 01:46.330
<i>I don't want to lose any more love</i>

01:46.330 --> 01:50.020
<i>There's still no line 
between today and tomorrow</i>

01:50.020 --> 01:53.590
<i>My waking nightmare doesn't end</i>

01:53.590 --> 01:57.220
<i>And yet I won't lose hope</i>

01:57.220 --> 02:03.270
<i>And yet there's no night that doesn't end</i>

02:03.270 --> 02:15.610
<i>Not here, not here</i>

02:20.080 --> 02:22.910
<i>When the two angels descend,</i>

02:23.420 --> 02:26.600
<i>a bridge of light will cross the sky</i>

02:26.600 --> 02:30.560
<i>and we will be led to the land of God.</i>

02:30.920 --> 02:35.930
Ugh, it's so hot... 
Say, can I change the radio?

02:31.530 --> 02:36.910
<i>Heed the words of Missionary Michael
 and Priest William.</i>

02:35.930 --> 02:36.910
Yeah.

02:38.180 --> 02:42.310
<i>The west is in for a strong, windless heat,</i>

02:39.770 --> 02:41.390
What was that, anyway?

02:41.390 --> 02:42.310
What?

02:42.310 --> 02:46.670
<i>raising the maximum temperature 
to around fifty degrees.</i>

02:43.670 --> 02:46.140
A religious program.

02:46.670 --> 02:50.620
The church of plant worshippers.

02:51.380 --> 02:54.680
You could say they're 
a newly established sect.

02:56.280 --> 02:59.380
I hear they've got a headquarters in JuLai.

03:04.120 --> 03:07.950
Ugh, yikes. I'm so sick of this heat.

03:07.950 --> 03:09.260
Originally...

03:09.260 --> 03:09.910
Huh?

03:09.910 --> 03:14.570
This stretch of desert was a normal color.

03:14.570 --> 03:15.790
Huh.

03:15.790 --> 03:17.130
Until one night!

03:18.310 --> 03:22.470
Out of nowhere, <i>it</i> appeared.

03:22.890 --> 03:27.600
Was it man or beast? 
To this day, nobody really knows.

03:27.600 --> 03:30.810
Because all who laid eyes on it...

03:31.240 --> 03:36.700
All who laid eyes on it were massacred!
Every last one of them!

03:39.210 --> 03:43.490
Overnight, the blood of its victims 
painted the whole desert

03:43.490 --> 03:45.950
the deep crimson that you see now.

03:48.150 --> 03:51.760
There. Was that chilling enough for you?

03:51.760 --> 03:54.210
Y-You just startled me. That's all.

04:03.690 --> 04:05.740
What's the matter?

04:06.590 --> 04:07.600
Over there.

04:16.190 --> 04:18.900
It's dead, right?

04:18.900 --> 04:21.350
One strike. Bare-handed.

04:21.350 --> 04:22.530
Bare-handed?

04:23.090 --> 04:25.580
Did one of Millions Knives's gang kill it?

04:26.520 --> 04:29.510
Maybe it was the monster 
I just told you about.

04:29.510 --> 04:31.080
No way.

04:31.080 --> 04:33.760
This thing's been dead for a while.

04:33.760 --> 04:37.720
Even if it Knives did it, he's long gone.

04:37.720 --> 04:38.970
Right, Needle-noggin?

04:47.090 --> 04:48.280
What's up?

04:48.890 --> 04:50.510
Wuh... Hey.

05:07.700 --> 05:11.700
#05 Child of Blessing

05:09.300 --> 05:15.590
<i>Now pray, and God shall send 
the angel of salvation our way.</i>

05:17.560 --> 05:22.380
<i>Praise the angel. Honor the angel.</i>

05:21.090 --> 05:22.380
Hey, Mom...

05:22.760 --> 05:24.930
<i>Become the angel's eyes.</i>

05:22.760 --> 05:26.850
Why does God eat the sacrificed children?

05:28.270 --> 05:30.930
To bring blessings.

05:31.420 --> 05:34.520
But those who get eaten die.

05:35.190 --> 05:38.230
Death is not the end. It's the beginning.

05:38.660 --> 05:41.890
Going to heaven is a wonderful thing.

05:45.390 --> 05:48.750
Doesn't look like anyone lives here anymore.

05:48.750 --> 05:50.950
It's weirdly quiet.

05:50.950 --> 05:54.320
Check it out. They've got no plant.

05:54.320 --> 05:56.570
Could it have been stolen?

05:56.570 --> 05:58.640
No, I think...

05:59.280 --> 06:02.210
They used to spin that to make power.

06:03.110 --> 06:04.380
A windmill?

06:04.850 --> 06:05.970
It's not moving.

06:06.560 --> 06:08.590
Obviously, there's no wind.

06:09.050 --> 06:12.120
So what do you do if there's,
 like, never any wind?

06:12.120 --> 06:14.560
It would mean a prolonged power outage.

06:14.560 --> 06:17.530
Huh? What kind of stupid system is that?

06:17.530 --> 06:20.770
That's just how wind power works.

06:20.770 --> 06:22.230
Sounds dumb.

06:47.780 --> 06:48.550
Vash!

06:48.550 --> 06:49.370
Get back!

06:51.070 --> 06:53.090
Idiot! Don't just jump in!

06:53.090 --> 06:54.620
O-Okay.

07:03.940 --> 07:08.550
Vash the Stampede!

07:10.400 --> 07:12.810
Idiot! What're you doing just sitting around?!

07:13.760 --> 07:14.910
Right.

07:15.510 --> 07:18.700
This fella knows Vash?

07:18.700 --> 07:19.660
Seems so.

07:21.140 --> 07:28.360
Vash... the... Stampede!

07:32.100 --> 07:33.220
Vash!

07:33.220 --> 07:35.140
Hide inside a house!

07:35.140 --> 07:36.770
He's only after me!

07:39.000 --> 07:40.270
Stubborn grunt.

07:40.590 --> 07:42.480
Vash the...

07:46.510 --> 07:47.400
Wolfwood!

08:12.560 --> 08:15.540
Vash...

08:17.140 --> 08:21.270
Vash the Stampede...

08:28.070 --> 08:31.440
Hey, did you already talk to Rollo?

08:31.440 --> 08:35.060
No, it's too hard for me.

08:35.060 --> 08:39.360
I understand. But we all got over it.

08:40.370 --> 08:45.080
Think of it this way. Your child born on a 
windless day is finally getting his blessing.

08:45.080 --> 08:46.920
It's a wonderful thing.

08:46.920 --> 08:49.650
Yes, you're right.

08:49.650 --> 08:51.290
When Rollo comes home,

08:51.290 --> 08:54.230
I'll let him know that he's 
been chosen as the sacrifice.

08:54.930 --> 08:56.770
Yes, yes, good.

08:56.770 --> 08:58.140
That'd be best.

09:13.900 --> 09:17.820
Vash the Stampede!

09:35.880 --> 09:36.830
Are you okay?

09:40.440 --> 09:42.790
Thank goodness. You're still alive.

09:45.000 --> 09:51.110
Vash the Stam—

09:53.380 --> 09:54.650
You dolt!

09:54.650 --> 09:56.040
You tryin' to get killed!?

09:56.570 --> 09:57.780
We run for now!

09:57.780 --> 09:59.230
Y-Yeah!

10:09.700 --> 10:11.660
U-Um...

10:12.150 --> 10:13.170
Yeah?

10:13.670 --> 10:16.180
Are Vash and Wolfwood all right?

10:17.640 --> 10:19.310
Who knows?

10:19.960 --> 10:25.990
You stay out of this, newbie. 
There's nothing we can do here.

10:28.850 --> 10:34.740
Vash... the... Stampede...

10:42.570 --> 10:44.530
You dumbass.

10:45.180 --> 10:47.620
I've had it with your 
insufferable do-gooder routine.

10:47.620 --> 10:51.410
I mean... I was worried 
that might've been the end of him.

10:51.410 --> 10:53.960
Someone oughta end <i>you.</i>

10:55.530 --> 10:57.250
That's savage, man.

10:58.440 --> 10:59.550
Well?

10:59.550 --> 11:00.650
Huh?

11:00.650 --> 11:01.930
Stop playing dumb.

11:02.570 --> 11:05.880
You knew about this village, didn't you?

11:06.540 --> 11:08.180
What happened here?

11:09.810 --> 11:13.400
I don't know, either. Just that...

11:30.620 --> 11:31.870
Are you all right?

11:34.830 --> 11:38.430
Finally found you. Are you Rollo?

11:44.430 --> 11:49.180
Your mother asked me to find you. 
You ran away from home, huh?

11:50.530 --> 11:54.190
No, it's not that...

11:55.370 --> 11:58.530
You must be Vash the Stampede, right?

11:59.720 --> 12:01.520
You know about me?

12:02.300 --> 12:08.290
Yeah, you're famous. 
They call you the Humanoid Typhoon.

12:08.290 --> 12:11.780
Er, where did you hear that?

12:11.780 --> 12:13.630
There was more.

12:13.630 --> 12:18.280
You're a walking natural disaster.
A demon that causes mayhem.

12:25.010 --> 12:30.430
I'm sick. They say I'll die before I grow up.

12:32.110 --> 12:38.290
Maybe God won't save me 
because I don't believe in him.

12:46.870 --> 12:49.540
There's no wind, and everyone's
 suffering because of it.

12:49.540 --> 12:52.120
It must be rough without a plant.

12:52.660 --> 12:54.200
That's why I'm next...

12:54.200 --> 12:55.110
Huh?

12:58.430 --> 13:00.630
Was my mom worried?

13:01.870 --> 13:04.340
Yes, very much.

13:05.010 --> 13:07.460
If you need help, remember me!

13:07.460 --> 13:09.240
I promise I'll be there for you.

13:12.720 --> 13:16.140
If God won't save you, I will!

13:28.380 --> 13:33.390
Yet by the time I got my hands on some
 medicine and returned, Rollo was...

13:33.390 --> 13:40.740
So you talked a big game about saving him
 but couldn't follow through.

13:45.880 --> 13:47.650
Here it comes.

13:51.030 --> 13:55.330
<i>For those who believe in God, 
death is not the end.</i>

13:55.890 --> 14:00.620
<i>Only those who believe 
find salvation and love.</i>

14:03.030 --> 14:06.400
<i>Rejoice in death. Praise death.</i>

14:08.820 --> 14:12.270
<i>May God bless you.</i>

14:14.160 --> 14:15.380
Who are you?

14:19.410 --> 14:21.880
Are you God?

14:21.880 --> 14:27.130
The man you praise as God 
is not here right now.

14:29.500 --> 14:31.230
Please let go...

14:39.900 --> 14:43.270
Are you... a sacrifice, too?

14:43.650 --> 14:46.650
Me? Think again.

14:48.390 --> 14:50.220
I'm an angel.

14:58.540 --> 15:02.780
This drug will rebuild and strengthen
your body at the cellular level,

15:02.780 --> 15:05.960
as well as accelerate your 
metabolism to the extreme.

15:08.100 --> 15:12.470
If you can adapt to it, 
it should cure your illness.

15:13.260 --> 15:16.700
Of course, there will some side effects,

15:16.700 --> 15:20.580
but at the very least, 
it won't be the illness that kills you.

15:40.120 --> 15:42.240
I... don't want to die...

15:42.240 --> 15:46.810
Help me, Vash...

15:46.810 --> 15:52.550
Vash the Stampede!

15:53.260 --> 15:54.700
You're wide open!

15:58.720 --> 15:59.720
Wolfwood!

16:07.620 --> 16:14.490
Vash the Stampede!

16:14.490 --> 16:19.210
The implant in his brain 
will heighten his emotions,

16:19.210 --> 16:23.170
leading to accelerated 
development of athletic abilities.

16:23.860 --> 16:27.850
Hatred is a poison to the soul.

16:27.850 --> 16:32.380
It's a toxin more potent than 
the venom glands of Worms.

16:33.270 --> 16:36.140
He's the first to survive 
for five whole years.

16:36.940 --> 16:38.480
Finally, a success...

16:38.480 --> 16:40.930
He'll just be another failure.

16:45.890 --> 16:46.940
Who is it?

16:48.650 --> 16:51.400
Mom? It's me.

16:51.400 --> 16:52.700
Rollo?

16:52.700 --> 16:54.860
Yes, it's me.

17:01.730 --> 17:02.980
Mom.

17:03.750 --> 17:05.220
I'm home.

17:05.820 --> 17:07.250
You monster...

17:07.960 --> 17:13.210
No, I'm... I am...

17:15.880 --> 17:16.900
Rollo!

17:18.660 --> 17:23.820
<i>God shall send the angel 
of salvation our way.</i>

17:23.820 --> 17:26.080
What is this place?

17:25.010 --> 17:30.380
<i>When the angel descends, 
we will be led to the land of God.</i>

17:26.080 --> 17:30.380
Looks like it's been this way for a while.
Maybe twenty years.

17:32.360 --> 17:35.030
<i>Rejoice in death. Praise death.</i>

17:35.430 --> 17:37.520
<i>Death is not the end.</i>

17:40.470 --> 17:42.950
Wh-What is this?

17:43.390 --> 17:45.000
What'd you find, newbie?

17:45.470 --> 17:47.530
Um, this is...

17:48.820 --> 17:51.560
Isn't this Vash?

17:57.220 --> 17:59.770
You're Rollo! Don't you remember?!

18:02.640 --> 18:05.490
It's no use. He's...

18:07.110 --> 18:09.270
just a monster now.

18:15.730 --> 18:17.150
Listen to me, Rollo!

18:17.690 --> 18:18.700
I'm—

18:37.390 --> 18:38.550
Rollo...

18:39.890 --> 18:43.010
I'm sorry... Back then...

18:45.830 --> 18:47.350
Back then...

18:49.210 --> 18:53.830
I promised you, but I...

19:06.540 --> 19:09.020
You insufferable fool.

19:12.010 --> 19:16.690
I'm so sorry I'm late. 
I'm here to keep my word.

19:18.620 --> 19:22.690
You won't be alone anymore...

19:28.920 --> 19:31.050
You dumbass!

19:39.580 --> 19:40.690
Rollo!

20:23.170 --> 20:25.740
Wake up, Rollo.

20:27.300 --> 20:29.620
Please wake up, Rollo!

20:30.450 --> 20:35.050
Rollo... Come on, Rollo... Come on!

20:35.050 --> 20:36.630
Enough already.

20:37.460 --> 20:38.850
He's dead.

20:42.810 --> 20:44.130
Why'd you shoot?

20:44.890 --> 20:47.110
Why?! Why shoot Rollo?!

20:49.330 --> 20:50.520
Mercy.

20:53.860 --> 20:56.850
There's no way to return his humanity.

20:56.850 --> 20:59.010
Keeping him alive is torture.

21:00.820 --> 21:03.260
That's not for you to decide.

21:03.990 --> 21:06.340
Your hypocrisy is showing.

21:06.990 --> 21:10.870
You're the one saying things 
you can't even make good on.

21:11.680 --> 21:14.730
At best, it's all talk.

21:25.940 --> 21:27.280
The wind...

21:38.100 --> 21:40.650
I see. So he's dead.

21:42.550 --> 21:48.050
How convenient. Saves you 
the trouble of getting rid of a failure.

21:49.710 --> 21:54.760
Well, it was another of the 
doctor's creations that did the job.

21:55.710 --> 21:59.420
Oh, right. Nicholas, was it?

22:00.440 --> 22:04.660
No... the Punisher.

22:04.500 --> 22:06.500


22:20.060 --> 22:27.680
<i>Your light...</i>

22:34.140 --> 22:38.440
<i>If that light never changes</i>

22:38.440 --> 22:42.870
<i>And continues to shine high above the sky</i>

22:42.870 --> 22:47.180
<i>Even when I'm lost, 
even when I'm struggling</i>

22:47.180 --> 22:51.430
<i>I'll continue to search for you</i>

22:51.430 --> 22:55.720
<i>Even on days of sickness or sadness</i>

22:55.720 --> 23:00.100
<i>I'll open the window to a new morning</i>

23:00.100 --> 23:04.290
<i>I'm moving forward, I'm standing still</i>

23:04.290 --> 23:07.850
<i>Tell the people who are praying</i>

23:07.850 --> 23:13.810
<i>But today this flower 
before me is praising you</i>

23:13.810 --> 23:16.820
<i>My song is a song of joy and wishes</i>

23:16.820 --> 23:19.540
<i>Yes, I'm reaching out</i>

23:19.540 --> 23:24.880
<i>But you're too high up 
in the evening stars</i>

23:24.880 --> 23:30.850
<i>But today this flower 
before me is praising you</i>

23:30.850 --> 23:34.000
<i>My song is a song of joy and wishes</i>

23:34.000 --> 23:36.700
<i>Yes, I try to reach out</i>

23:36.700 --> 23:41.860
<i>But you're too high up 
in the evening stars</i>
